  message: "PREMISE AUDIT 2026-10-03 (owner-requested; read-only, reproduced at dev 3abedae588 on small fixtures). CURRENT. `.venv/bin/python -m hypergumbo_core.cli --help` prints 0 bytes, rc=0. hypergumbo_core/__main__.py exists and works (python -m hypergumbo_core); cli.py has no __main__ guard, and no commit since 2026-09-09 adds one.\n- One more instance of the same trap: hypergumbo_core/runtime_coherence.py:289 defines main() with no guard (lower risk: it is invoked via scripts/check-edge-type-runtime-coherence). test_masking.py and hypergumbo_tracker/cli.py have guards."  # 9942
